{
  "abstract": "Differential cross sections for p\u2212p elastic scattering are presented with scattering angles in the center-of-mass system greater than 35\u00b0 to 50\u00b0. The data were obtained at incident laboratory momenta 0.857, 1.091, 1.210, 1.374, 1.405, and 1.501 GeV/c. This spans the region of the onset of \u0394(1236) production and where a possible spin-singlet D-wave resonance is indicated in an analysis of earlier data.",
